> `boy_01_pc_v2.ipynb` has a minor render.py difference: it slices points to `[:, :3]` (because its `.xyz` files have extra columns). This will be handled by making the slice conditional on a new optional config key `SLICE_XYZ_COLS` (default: `False`).

## Verification Plan

### Manual Verification
- Visually inspect the generated `master_render.ipynb` to ensure:
  - All 6 config cells are present with correct values
  - Master config cell correctly writes `config.py` with all configs
  - Render.py loops over `RENDER_TYPES` correctly
  - The notebook structure is valid JSON (can be opened in Colab/VS Code)
